    },
    "warning": "m_isOrthographic is a TMP component flag, not Camera.orthographic. All 12 exported Lava Competition/Start TMP records are false although the Home camera is orthographic.",
    "worldProjection": "Apply each glyph/character scale and the TMP world2d matrix once. Under no rotation and uniform scale: canvasGlyphUnit = glyphLocalUnit * worldScale * canvasBackingPixelsPerWorldUnit.",
    "currentBoxAdapter": "If HTML box height represents TMP rectSize.y transformed to world and projected, unitHeight=glyphLocalUnit/rectSize.y; unit=unitHeight*canvasBackingHeight. worldScale is already included in box height: do not multiply it again.",
    "nonUniformOrRotatedBoundary": "A scalar unit cannot preserve nonuniform scale or rotation. Use local canvas geometry then the full world2d matrix, or separately preserve scaleX/scaleY and rotation.",
    "canvasBackingScale": "setup(el) backs the canvas at min(3,devicePixelRatio||1)*2 times CSS pixels. Use backing pixels throughout; do not mix CSS pixels and backing pixels.",
    "minimumChange": "Use original glyphLocalUnit as the requested size. Any width/height fit must only shrink, never enlarge to fill the box. Existing unitHeight support can implement this without rebuilding the renderer.",
    "autoSizeBoundary": "The saved m_fontSize values provide the original authored/resolved starting sizes. Auto-sizing remains enabled; language, runtime content, material and layout changes can recalculate them. Do not substitute m_fontSizeBase or m_fontSizeMax, or claim these are live sampled sizes."
  },
