    "algorithm": [
      "Generate the uncurved TMP mesh; skip invisible characters (spaces still affect pen advance).",
      "For each visible character use pivot=((quadBottomLeft.x+quadTopRight.x)/2, characterInfo.baseLine, 0). Subtract this pivot from its four vertices.",
      "Compute t=(pivot.x-textBounds.min.x)/(textBounds.max.x-textBounds.min.x); this uses actual TMP mesh bounds, not RectTransform width or the sum of advances.",
      "Evaluate dy=CurveScale*C(t). Evaluate the tangent using dt=0.00009999999747378752: dx=(textBounds.max.x-textBounds.min.x)*dt; ddy=CurveScale*(C(t+dt)-C(t)).",
      "Apply T(0,dy,0)*Rz(atan2(ddy,dx))*S(1,1,1) to the centered quad; add original pivot back. Native GetCharScale returns Vector3.one (static field offset0x0c).",
      "Finally apply the TMP world transform and camera. For a Y-down canvas, the curve goes upward (-dy) and the Z angle changes sign."
    ],
    "boundaries": [
      "weightedMode=0 on both keys: ordinary cubic Hermite; serialized weights must not be used as weighted Bezier controls.",
      "CurveScale is already in text-local Unity units after glyph sizing. Do not multiply the rise by fontSize/1000 again.",
      "The Start title runtime ArrangeTitle writes CurveScale=3.4 and localY=5.007999897; Competition retains1.2. Both MaxThreeCheckDisabled=true; short-string curve suppression does not disable them.",
      "The Start button has no TextProOnAnAnimationCurve component.",
      "Using raw glyph ink bounds instead of the original TMP mesh bounds introduces a small curve/pivot difference because the mesh can include material padding. Preserve this distinction until exact mesh/material padding is implemented.",
      "Curved text needs vertical headroom. Do not independently re-center each raised glyph or normalize the curved group to fill its box."
    ]
  },
